  "description": "Despite his job as a corrections officer, Jeong-Won is terrified - but it’s not the incarcerated criminals that scare him. No, what Jeong-Won is scared of is the possibility of someone discovering the secret love he’s being harboring for his stepbrother, Ye-Jun. But when the two come face to face in the confines of the concrete cells, Jeong-Won will not be able to hide any longer. Forced to confront his past, will Jeong-Won be forever bound to his guilt? Or will he finally break free of the prison he's created for himself?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
